; historycleaner.app → GitHub Pages
; BIND zone file (RFC 1035) for import in Hostinger hPanel → DNS records → Import.
;
; Contains ONLY the website records. On purpose there is NO SOA, NS, MX, TXT(SPF/DKIM/DMARC):
; those are managed by Hostinger and are needed for support@historycleaner.app.
;
; BEFORE IMPORT: replace KULLANICI-ADIN below with your GitHub username (keep the final dot).
; AFTER IMPORT: delete Hostinger's old "@ A" record (the parking IP) if it is still there.

$ORIGIN historycleaner.app.
$TTL 3600

; apex → GitHub Pages (IPv4)
@       IN  A      185.199.108.153
@       IN  A      185.199.109.153
@       IN  A      185.199.110.153
@       IN  A      185.199.111.153

; apex → GitHub Pages (IPv6)
@       IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8000::153
@       IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8001::153
@       IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8002::153
@       IN  AAAA   2606:50c0:8003::153

; www → GitHub Pages
www     IN  CNAME  KULLANICI-ADIN.github.io.
